== Introduction ==

Villains was one of the first big european 4on4 leagues lead by the headadmin {{flag/se}} [[Egowhip]]. It was a team deatchmatch invite only tournament for the best clans in Europe.  

The only maps allowed where [[TB3]] and all games were BO3, with the exception of the grand finals which was BO5.

It was played with a group structure of four groups, from every group the best two clans proceeded to an eight team playoff.

